    {
      "index": 1,
      "type": "question",
      "text": "自前のLLM推論を、通常のWeb APIと同じ指標で増減させますか。",
      "audio": "interview-question-01.mp3",
      "audioHash": "d87324e9d71b43532cc2ff9b1dbac2370140500ae1bbb383fb68a87a4f08f3bb",
